    "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:24:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-11T04:28:53Z",
    "body": "I believe this would be addressed by making the \"fragment serializing algorithm\" invoke https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/xhtml.html#xml-fragment-serialisation-algorithm for the non-HTML case, which is currently unreferenced by any specification (including HTML).\n\nEdit: well, it addresses it if you assume that \"must be an isomorphic serialization\" is implicitly referencing https://w3c.github.io/DOM-Parsing/#dfn-xml-serialization, since the HTML algorithm is written in a super arm's-length manner and doesn't actually specify how to perform the serialization.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
