    "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:15:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-20T13:15:35Z",
    "body": "I believe this is in part caused by the XML serialisation being completely detached from the rest of the html spec. We need to finish moving Dom parsing into the main spec and hopefully then it will better allow us to fix these kinds of issues. I believe outerHTML is also broken.",
